        "CopyrightInformation": "Crown Copyright © 2008. Published by Elsevier Ireland Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Chlamydia pneumoniae (C. pneumoniae) infection in coronary artery disease (CAD) is confirmed by many workers. However our knowledge on relationship between infection and atherosclerosis is still in infancy. In this report we discuss why should relatives of patients with CAD have contracted C. pneumoniae infection?"
      },
